---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Base title="About | Chris Green" description="About Chris Green, cybersecurity leader, penetration tester, and speaker.">
  <Header />
  <main>
    <article class="simple-page container">
      <header>
        <p class="page-label">About</p>
        <h1>Security leadership grounded in technical practice.</h1>
      </header>
      <div class="simple-prose">
        <p class="lead">I’m a cybersecurity professional focused on governance, risk, compliance, and offensive security.</p>
        <p>I lead GRC and penetration testing consulting teams and work with organizations to connect regulatory expectations, business priorities, and real-world threats. My role often sits between leadership and deeply technical teams—turning findings into shared understanding and practical next steps.</p>
        <p>My technical background shapes how I approach governance. Controls should be testable, risk should be supported by evidence, and recommendations should make sense in the environment where they will actually be implemented.</p>
        <p>I speak regularly on CJIS, HIPAA, PCI, CMMC, privacy, artificial intelligence, penetration testing, and zero-trust initiatives.</p>
        <p class="credentials"><strong>Credentials</strong><br />CISSP · OSCP · CISA · CRISC · QSA/PCIP · CMMC RP</p>
        <p><a href="mailto:x63x67@proton.me">x63x67@proton.me</a></p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>
